OL,3,GNEWSACourt papers reveal mayor's #2.7m
OL,4,Ainterest in major rail scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elected mayor who campaigned against
OL,7,FEast West Rail's preferred route had a
OL,8,Fmajor financial interest in the project
OL,9,Fwhich was not recorded as having been
OL,10,Fdeclared during a meeting in parliament
OL,11,Fwith the rail minister, it has emerged.
OL,13,FTom Wootton, Bedford Borough Council's
OL,14,FConservative mayor, also commissioned a
OL,15,Fpublicly-funded study into alternative
OL,16,Froutes that would avoid splitting his
OL,17,Ffamily's farm.
OL,19,FUnder the council's code of conduct,
OL,20,Fcouncillors must say when an item of
OL,21,Fbusiness affects their finances or
OL,22,Fland, or those of close family members.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
